    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31230" root="عيط" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاطَتْ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعِيطُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعُوطُ</span>, (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْطٌ</span>
[perhaps a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيَطٌ</span>, which see below,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَلَبٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلَبٌ</span>], (TA,) <i>She</i> (a woman, TA)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, long in the neck,</i> (K, TA,) <i>with
justness of stature;</i> (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعيّطت</span></b>  and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعوّطت</span>. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عوط</span>.

